Google Play APK Downloader

This project was derived conceptually and structurally from Basil-AS/rustore-downloader,
then rewritten for Google Play delivery.

Runtime Google Play protocol implementation:
  gplaydl — Copyright (c) 2021 Rehmat Alam — MIT License
  https://github.com/rehmatworks/gplaydl
  pinned source commit: 7c3d87f20a5f61f6cfa7446683bb4c698bfa2396

Optional split-APK merge engine:
  APKEditor by REAndroid
  https://github.com/REAndroid/APKEditor
  downloaded from the latest upstream GitHub release during container build.

The .apks metadata layout follows the public SAI meta format documentation.
No SAI source code is incorporated.

